  "description": "Mokdan the woodcutter saves a deer, who promises to repay her and leads her to a hidden mountain pond, where she sees beautiful celestial lords bathing. When she accidentally ruins Gonghwa's celestial robe, he insists that she take him in, but why does this beautiful celestial keep coming onto her?\n\n(Source: Manta)\n\n*Note: The fourth story in Coconut's Jeonradonghwa Danpyeonseon (전라동화全裸童話 단편선) Collection.*",
